WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.578 --> 00:00:07.319
Once upon a time, there lived a beautiful girl.

2
00:00:07.959 --> 00:00:10.980
Jingnyeo was the daughter of the king of heaven.

3
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.681
Her father loved her very much.

4
00:00:14.441 --> 00:00:17.023
Jingnyeo was beautiful and kind-hearted.

5
00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:20.004
She was also an excellent weaver.

6
00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:25.486
The king decided it was time for Jingnyeo to get married.

7
00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:30.368
A search began to find her a husband, but it was not easy.

8
00:00:31.076 --> 00:00:34.357
After many days, the king was about to give up.

9
00:00:36.618 --> 00:00:41.180
Finally one day, the king found the perfect husband for Jingnyeo.

10
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.241
"Yes, that's him!

11
00:00:43.621 --> 00:00:45.362
He will marry my daughter!"

12
00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:47.163
shouted the excited king.

13
00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:52.505
And so, Kyunwoo the cattle farmer and Jingnyeo were married.

14
00:00:54.105 --> 00:00:57.607
Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo loved each other very much.

15
00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:00.268
They spent every day together.

16
00:01:01.192 --> 00:01:03.093
"Kyunwoo! Mind your cows!"

17
00:01:03.593 --> 00:01:04.834
the angry king yelled.

18
00:01:04.854 --> 00:01:10.016
"Oh, I beg your mercy, Your Highness," giggled Kyunwoo.

19
00:01:12.437 --> 00:01:15.078
Jingnyeo did not have time for her weaving.

20
00:01:15.638 --> 00:01:17.879
Kyunwoo did not have time for his cows.

21
00:01:18.719 --> 00:01:20.660
They only had time for each other.

22
00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:26.522
The king was very angry at Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo.

23
00:01:27.303 --> 00:01:30.184
"Since you got married, you have become lazy!"

24
00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.541
scolded the king.

25
00:01:31.561 --> 00:01:33.722
"Look at your cows!

26
00:01:34.182 --> 00:01:35.563
Look at your weaving frame!

27
00:01:36.544 --> 00:01:39.605
For this, you, Kyunwoo, will be sent to the east!

28
00:01:40.426 --> 00:01:42.967
And you, Jingnyeo, will be sent to the west!"

29
00:01:43.808 --> 00:01:47.010
Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo began crying before the king.

30
00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:53.894
"On the seventh day of July, you shall meet," the king continued.

31
00:01:53.914 --> 00:01:57.516
"But the Milky Way will separate you forever!"

32
00:02:01.032 --> 00:02:05.716
So after one year, on the seventh day of July, they saw each other again.

33
00:02:06.537 --> 00:02:08.179
It was not a happy meeting.

34
00:02:08.799 --> 00:02:11.462
Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo longed to be together.

35
00:02:12.222 --> 00:02:14.525
But the Milky Way still lay between them.

36
00:02:16.747 --> 00:02:20.430
Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo were not the only ones who were unhappy.

37
00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:24.274
"It must be the seventh day of July again!"

38
00:02:25.034 --> 00:02:26.656
shouted the animals and the birds.

39
00:02:27.588 --> 00:02:31.210
Every year, Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo's tears fell to the earth.

40
00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.672
Their many tears caused floods.

41
00:02:36.653 --> 00:02:38.774
The creatures of the earth held a meeting.

42
00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:42.556
"It is because Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo are apart!"

43
00:02:42.877 --> 00:02:43.837
complained the crow.

44
00:02:43.857 --> 00:02:46.859
"Their tears cause the floods!"

45
00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.640
sniffed the deer.

46
00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:54.563
"They must meet or we will all die from their tears!"

47
00:02:55.203 --> 00:02:55.964
said the rabbit.

48
00:02:56.992 --> 00:02:57.772
"But how?

49
00:02:58.152 --> 00:03:00.493
The Milky Way stands between them!"

50
00:03:00.933 --> 00:03:01.754
cried the deer.

51
00:03:02.894 --> 00:03:05.275
All the creatures thought and thought what to do.

52
00:03:07.355 --> 00:03:10.176
Finally, they came up with a brilliant plan.

53
00:03:11.076 --> 00:03:13.277
All the crows on the earth gathered together.

54
00:03:13.837 --> 00:03:16.878
They flew up to the sky, higher and higher.

55
00:03:17.778 --> 00:03:22.540
Then one by one, the birds lay down and formed a bridge.

56
00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.381
It was the day for Kyunwoo and Jingnyeo to meet again.

57
00:03:27.401 --> 00:03:29.182
"What is this?

58
00:03:29.702 --> 00:03:31.402
It is a bridge for me to cross!"

59
00:03:31.882 --> 00:03:34.563
Kyunwoo exclaimed when he saw what the crows had done.

60
00:03:34.583 --> 00:03:36.824
"Can this be true?

61
00:03:37.344 --> 00:03:39.104
Is that my beloved husband?"

62
00:03:39.584 --> 00:03:40.525
Jingnyeo shouted.

63
00:03:42.745 --> 00:03:46.206
At last, Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo were together once again.

64
00:03:47.106 --> 00:03:52.568
Thanks to the birds and the bridge they made, Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo could meet every year.

65
00:03:54.044 --> 00:03:58.167
On a clear night, you can still see Jingnyeo and Kyunwoo in the stars.

66
00:03:59.148 --> 00:04:04.973
Jingnyeo as the harp and Kyunwoo as the eagle are separated by the Milky Way.

67
00:04:05.913 --> 00:04:08.495
It no longer floods on the seventh day of July.

68
00:04:09.376 --> 00:04:14.200
But it may rain a little—not from tears of sorrow, but from tears of joy.
